**2П29Л (2P29L) — Low-Power RF Transmitting Pentode**

**General Specifications & Pinout**

* **Application:** RF power amplification and oscillation up to 120 MHz
* **Cathode:** Directly heated oxide cathode
* **Operating Position:** Any
* **Service Life:** $\ge 1000\text{ hours}$
* **Base / Construction:** Glass envelope with external shield; special 8-pin keyed base (Loktal-type)
* **Pinout:**
* Pins 1, 8: Filament / Cathode
* Pins 2, 6: Internal Shield
* Pin 3: Anode (Plate)
* Pin 4: Grid 3 (Suppressor grid)
* Pin 5: Grid 2 (Screen grid)
* Pin 7: Grid 1 (Control grid)



---

**Inter-electrode Capacitances**

| Parameter | Value | Unit |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Input Capacitance ($C_{in}$) | 4.3 | pF |
| Output Capacitance ($C_{out}$) | 5.5 | pF |
| Transfer / Grid-to-Plate Capacitance ($C_{ag1}$) | $\le 0.055$ | pF |
| Anode-to-Cathode Capacitance ($C_{ak}$) | $\le 0.03$ | pF |

---

**Nominal Electrical Operating Conditions**

| Parameter | Value / Tolerance | Unit |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Filament Voltage ($V_f$) | 2.2 | V |
| Anode Voltage ($V_a$) | 160 | V |
| Screen Grid Voltage ($V_{g2}$) | 120 | V |
| Suppressor Grid Voltage ($V_{g3}$) | 0 | V |
| Filament Current ($I_f$) | $122.5 \pm 17.5$ | mA |
| Anode Cut-off Current (at $V_{g1} = -17.5\text{ V}$) | $\le 1$ | mA |
| Screen Grid Current ($I_{g2}$) | $\le 2$ | mA |
| Transconductance / Mutual Conductance ($S$) (at $I_a = 10\text{ mA}$) | $2.15 \pm 0.35$ | mA/V |
| Control Grid Bias ($V_{g1}$) (at $I_a = 10\text{ mA}$) | $-5.5 \pm 1.7$ | V |
| Suppressor Grid Bias ($V_{g3}$)* | $-85\text{ }(+15 / -10)$ | V |
| Output Power ($P_{out}$)** | $\ge 1.2$ | W |
| Output Power at Reduced Filament Voltage ($V_f = 2.0\text{ V}$) | 1.0 | W |
| Reverse Control Grid Current ($I_{g1\text{ rev}}$) (at $I_a = 10\text{ mA}$) | $\le 0.6$ | µA |
| Cathode Emission Current ($I_{k\text{ em}}$) | $\ge 35$ | mA |

**Test condition: $V_{a\text{ load(rms)}} = 5\text{ V}$, $V_{g1\text{(rms)}} = 20\text{ V}$, $R_{g1} = 20\text{ k}\Omega$, $R_{L} = 6\text{ k}\Omega$.*

*Test condition: $V_{g3} = 15\text{ V}$, $V_{g1\text{(rms)}} = 20\text{ V}$, $R_{g1} = 20\text{ k}\Omega$, $R_{L} = 6\text{ k}\Omega$.*

---

**Maximum Ratings (Limiting Values)**

| Parameter | Value | Unit |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Maximum Filament Voltage ($V_{f\text{ max}}$) | 2.4 | V |
| Minimum Filament Voltage ($V_{f\text{ min}}$) | 2.0 | V |
| Maximum Anode Voltage ($V_{a\text{ max}}$) | 200 | V |
| Maximum Screen Grid Voltage ($V_{g2\text{ max}}$) | 150 | V |
| Maximum Anode Dissipation ($P_{a\text{ max}}$) | 2.0 | W |
| Maximum Screen Grid Dissipation ($P_{g2\text{ max}}$) | 0.7 | W |
| Maximum Cathode Current ($I_{k\text{ max}}$) | 20 | mA |');

