Web research CONTRADICTION FOUND: only documentation located is for ''GS23B'' (heater 6.3V/5.7A, va_max 3kV, pa_max 1.5kW, freq_max 1000MHz), which is explicitly a POWER TETRODE, not the triode this project''s classifier guessed. No datasheet for a plain ''GS23'' (without B) was found. Recommend physically checking for a trailing ''B'' on the tube marking before trusting any GS23B-derived figures - not applied to the record pending that check.
